FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786126702
OL,3,CCouple vow to celebrate Pride after
OL,4,Cbeing subjected to homophobic abuse
OL,6,FWith hundreds of abusive comments
OL,7,Fdirected towards the couple, Steven
OL,8,Fsaid that the level of anger took the
OL,9,Ffamily by surprise, leaving them
OL,10,Ffeeling like they were "drowning in
OL,11,Fnegativity" after one of the happiest
OL,12,Fdays of their lives.
OL,14,FSteven added although the abuse was
OL,15,Fcountered by a "lot of love" and
OL,16,Fsupport that made the couple feel
OL,17,F"very proud", he wished to highlight
OL,18,Fthe family's experience as a reason
OL,19,Fwhy Pride events, such as this
OL,20,Fweekend's Wigan Pride, are held and
OL,21,Fmatter so much to the LGBTQ+ community.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
