PN,36903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786126702
OL,3,CCouple vow to celebrate Pride after
OL,4,Cbeing subjected to homophobic abuse
OL,6,FIt comes as the actor Sir Ian
OL,7,FMcKellan, who grew up in Wigan, posted
OL,8,Fa video message ahead of town's Pride
OL,9,Fevent saying "Some people are gay. Get
OL,10,Fover it."
OL,12,FSteven, a floral designer, said, "Our
OL,13,Fwedding was a celebration of 15 years
OL,14,Fof love and commitment, and we wanted
OL,15,Fto add a floral, artistic flair to our
OL,16,Fphotos to allow us to express
OL,17,Fourselves in the way that we wanted to.
OL,26,@qD@NOUtD@bOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786126702
OL,3,CCouple vow to celebrate Pride after
OL,4,Cbeing subjected to homophobic abuse
OL,6,F"But never in my mind did I think we
OL,7,Fwould get this level of abuse. It
OL,8,Fseemed like people came out of their
OL,9,Fway to direct their negative comments
OL,10,Fat us, which I don't think would
OL,11,Fhappen to heterosexual couples posting
OL,12,Ftheir wedding photos.
OL,14,F"We should be allowed to share our
OL,15,Flove online, in the way that we want
OL,16,Fto express ourselves, and not to
OL,17,Fexperience so much negativity which
OL,18,Fmakes us question whether we can hold
OL,19,Fhands in public or if it's safe enough
OL,20,Fto open my shop if people know where I
OL,21,Fwork."
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@AOU}D@FO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
