CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786126702
OL,3,CCouple vow to celebrate Pride after
OL,4,Cbeing subjected to homophobic abuse
OL,6,FSteven added that "posting wedding
OL,7,Fphotos is not consent to be abused".
OL,9,FHe said, "We are two husbands. We are
OL,10,Fparents. We are raising a young son
OL,11,Fwho is loved beyond measure.
OL,13,F"Reading comments that call us child
OL,14,Fmolesters, question our ability to be
OL,15,Fparents, or claim our son must be
OL,16,Funhappy because he has two dads isn't
OL,17,F'having an opinion', it's hatred.
OL,19,F"It's dehumanising and has real
OL,20,Fconsequences for real families."
OL,26,@qD@JOUuD@AOU{D@AOU|D@`O]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/11
