PN,36906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786126702
OL,3,CCouple vow to celebrate Pride after
OL,4,Cbeing subjected to homophobic abuse
OL,6,FSteven affirmed his support for this
OL,7,Fweekend's Pride event in Wigan.
OL,9,F"Pride is the one place where my
OL,10,Fhusband, my son, and I can walk hand
OL,11,Fin hand without wondering who might
OL,12,Fshout abuse," he added.
OL,14,F"It's a place where our son can look
OL,15,Faround and see families like his
OL,16,Fcelebrated instead of criticised. It's
OL,17,Fwhere, for one day, we don't have to
OL,18,Fexplain our existence or justify our
OL,19,Flove."
OL,26,@qD@AOUtD@MO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/11
