PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786126702
OL,3,CCouple vow to celebrate Pride after
OL,4,Cbeing subjected to homophobic abuse
OL,6,FMeanwhile, Sir Ian McKellen delivered
OL,7,Fhis own message to the town ahead of
OL,8,Fthe celebrations.
OL,10,FThe acclaimed Oscar-nominated actor,
OL,11,Fwho has appeared in movies including
OL,12,Fthe Lord of the Rings trilogy, X-Men,
OL,13,Fand Gods and Monsters, has been a
OL,14,Fstaunch campaigner for LGBTQ+ rights
OL,15,Fthroughout his career and attended the
OL,16,Fevent in 2017.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36908
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786126702
OL,3,CCouple vow to celebrate Pride after
OL,4,Cbeing subjected to homophobic abuse
OL,6,FThe 87-year-old said, "No Pride in
OL,7,FWigan when I was a kid. Not in the
OL,8,Fsense that it's celebrated today. And
OL,9,FI just wanted to send my love and I
OL,10,Fwish I could be with you because it's
OL,11,Fan important event.
OL,13,F"Gay people can just walk in the
OL,14,Fstreets, proud to be themselves, proud
OL,15,Fto say that they're gay, and they can
OL,16,Fbe supported by their allies, friends,
OL,17,Ffamily and neighbours. And Wigan can
OL,18,Ffeel better about itself."
OL,26,@uD@AOUzD@ZO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36909
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786126702
OL,3,CCouple vow to celebrate Pride after
OL,4,Cbeing subjected to homophobic abuse
OL,6,FConcluding the video by sharing the
OL,7,Fsame message written on his T-Shirt,
OL,8,Fhe added: "So, all my love. Some
OL,9,Fpeople are gay, get over it."
OL,11,FScott Williams, from the Wigan Pride
OL,12,Fcommittee, said: "It was amazing to
OL,13,Fget the video message from Sir Ian. He
OL,14,Fwas the original inspiration behind
OL,15,FWigan Pride. On a visit to Wigan years
OL,16,Fago, he asked why the town didn't have
OL,17,Fa Pride event, and that led to the
OL,18,Fcreation of the first Wigan Pride the
OL,19,Fyear later.
OL,26,@pD@KOUqD@]O]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
