FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36910
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786126702
OL,3,CCouple vow to celebrate Pride after
OL,4,Cbeing subjected to homophobic abuse
OL,6,F"I think he's an icon and an
OL,7,Fincredible ambassador for the LGBTQ+
OL,8,Fcommunity.
OL,10,F"I know Sir Ian can't be with us on
OL,11,Fthe day but we know that he'll be with
OL,12,Fus in spirit, and we really appreciate
OL,13,Fhis message of support."
OL,15,FWigan Pride is supported by Wigan
OL,16,FCouncil and will place on Saturday
OL,17,F(August 8) with performances from the
OL,18,Flikes of RuPaul's Drag Race UK star
OL,19,FBanskie and 00s band Big Brovas &
OL,20,FBooty Luv.
OL,26,@rD@AOUuD@XO]
