OL,3,CCouple vow to celebrate Pride after
OL,4,Cbeing subjected to homophobic abuse
OL,6,FIt will also include a parade, which
OL,7,Fwill begin at 11am on Crawford Street.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G11/11
